Subject: [PATCH] Toolpath: the view's toolbar stays on one row (labels where
 there is room, a sideways scroll on a phone), the XY label sits beside the
 3D/2D switch, below lg the panel button shows only to bring a closed panel
 back, and the View menu shows its labels on a phone (finding H3-9)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVyxNm2Fwb8M6A8TiczcwA
---
 src/components/ToolpathViewer.tsx | 26 ++++++++++++++------------
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/components/ToolpathViewer.tsx b/src/components/ToolpathViewer.tsx
index 5d34392..9c3a978 100644
--- a/src/components/ToolpathViewer.tsx
